{"description":"Message of a Timeline Entry on an evidence timeline that carries one whole proof. Acceptance is decided only by the proof's public output; document and operationEntry are a routing hint. The schema is open: the processor checks that receipt, document and operationEntry are the only fields and are well formed, and skips an entry that is not.","document":{"description":"The document, named by its initial BlueId, the same for every participant, normally written as the reference {blueId: ...} as an Operation Request writes its document. A free field: the processor compares the BlueId of this field with the document's initial BlueId; this schema checks nothing."},"name":"Proof Entry","operationEntry":{"description":"The operation's Timeline Entry, named by its BlueId and normally written as the reference {blueId: ...}. A free field: the processor compares the BlueId of this field with the BlueId of the operation entry; this schema checks nothing."},"receipt":{"description":"Complete proof in the single encoding admitted by the channel's evidence profile, as canonical base64 text: RFC 4648 standard alphabet with padding, zero pad bits and no other characters. Presence, text form and encoding are checked by the processor, not by this schema."},"specification":{"blueId":"9MdKsAApwjLjFXTw75necZ5XPuY4o5M7SX2bF5zNrwij"}}
